WEBVTT

00:10.920 --> 00:12.710
This is how I'll become...

00:15.710 --> 00:17.460
This is how I'll become...

00:19.460 --> 00:21.250
...Supreme Commander.

00:21.540 --> 00:22.830
... a hero.

00:23.250 --> 00:25.000
This is my story!

01:56.630 --> 02:00.330
<b>Sisters, Yachiho, Ridicule</b>

02:06.500 --> 02:07.330
Hey...

02:07.830 --> 02:10.000
There's something I want to ask you...

02:12.500 --> 02:16.250
Did Yachiho do any training
in preparation for today's match?

02:20.130 --> 02:22.670
Anything you can tell me would be great.

02:26.710 --> 02:28.170
Wake up!

02:33.580 --> 02:36.750
Yacchi wasn't acting
any different than usual.

02:36.750 --> 02:39.250
She's been in a good mood!

02:40.040 --> 02:43.210
Guess that means
she doesn't expect much, Himarin.

02:45.420 --> 02:47.040
Is everyone ready?

02:48.380 --> 02:50.290
Now then, let the first match...

02:51.170 --> 02:52.830
begin!

02:52.830 --> 02:54.790
I'm warning you, Himari.

02:54.790 --> 02:56.540
You won't last a second against-

02:58.500 --> 02:59.790
<b>BRAND BREAK!</b>

02:59.830 --> 03:03.130
Where in the hell did THAT come from?!

03:04.630 --> 03:06.420
Golden Hour!

03:06.630 --> 03:08.130
Rewind five seconds!

03:06.880 --> 03:08.080
<b>AZUMA TIME: GOLDEN HOUR</b>

03:09.330 --> 03:09.880
<b>BRAND BREAK!</b>

03:15.330 --> 03:16.630
...begin!

03:16.630 --> 03:18.130
She's tired...

03:18.130 --> 03:20.960
We planned ahead in case we couldn't
finish her off with a single blow!

03:20.960 --> 03:22.580
Let's stick to our strategy!

03:29.250 --> 03:31.250
A gun modded for use in Mato...

03:31.540 --> 03:33.630
I knew that'd be her main weapon.

03:34.210 --> 03:37.330
Leaping into the air where she's
a sitting duck was a dumb move.

03:37.330 --> 03:41.000
When she starts coming down,
I'll use Golden Hour to freeze time...

03:43.540 --> 03:44.830
and BLAST her!

03:47.580 --> 03:48.630
Do it now!

03:57.380 --> 03:59.290
<b>BRAND BREAK!</b>

04:06.170 --> 04:07.880
Golden Hour!

04:11.460 --> 04:13.880
<b>AZUMA TIME: GOLDEN HOUR</b>

04:11.790 --> 04:13.250
Rewind five seconds!

04:21.000 --> 04:23.540
An airborne kick to gain momentum...

04:23.540 --> 04:26.000
She really cut it close with that one.

04:26.500 --> 04:27.420
But...

04:27.420 --> 04:29.880
If I activate my ability
sooner than before,

04:29.880 --> 04:34.080
they'll be moving into my attack
range when I freeze time!

04:35.080 --> 04:36.500
Golden Hour!

04:38.920 --> 04:40.330
<b>AZUMA TIME: GOLDEN HOUR</b>

04:41.290 --> 04:42.830
Freeze for five seconds!

04:44.830 --> 04:46.630
Wait, where'd they go?!

04:49.960 --> 04:51.330
Out of range...

04:51.330 --> 04:53.920
She's changing tactics on purpose!

05:03.790 --> 05:06.330
Yes! We made her waste her ability!

05:06.710 --> 05:08.670
Stand your ground and stick to the plan!

05:08.670 --> 05:09.630
Got it!

05:13.790 --> 05:15.290
I-incredible!

05:15.710 --> 05:17.630
They're faster than a speeding bullet!

05:17.880 --> 05:20.540
Is Himari trying to confuse her opponent?!

05:20.540 --> 05:23.460
She's begun running circles
around Yachiho!

05:24.290 --> 05:26.670
I can feel it in my bones...

05:26.670 --> 05:28.830
I can feel how desperately
Himari wants to win!

05:29.420 --> 05:31.670
As for my ultimate goal...

05:32.960 --> 05:35.670
I want to be a hero like the commander.

05:36.170 --> 05:40.250
I feel like I'll become a new version
of myself if I can beat Yachiho.

05:41.750 --> 05:43.420
I have to help her win!

05:43.670 --> 05:45.130
I'll make sure of it!

05:48.880 --> 05:51.080
Yeah, show her who's boss!

05:51.080 --> 05:53.170
It's almost like I'm seeing double!

06:00.790 --> 06:01.750
Now!

06:10.920 --> 06:12.960
You petulant brat...

06:13.250 --> 06:16.830
Sweet, we threw her off balance!
Just like we planned!

06:18.580 --> 06:21.040
They certainly came prepared, didn't they?

06:21.040 --> 06:23.290
It's shaping up to be a good match.

06:23.290 --> 06:26.210
Y'think Yacchi will be okay?

06:26.210 --> 06:30.040
I assumed his servitude was reserved
exclusively for Kyou,

06:30.040 --> 06:35.750
but it seems he's capable of
devoting himself to a new master, too.

06:38.460 --> 06:41.080
This guy... I mean, Yuuki.

06:41.080 --> 06:44.460
He's busting his ass for me,
more than I expected him to.

06:45.540 --> 06:48.630
I'll have to apologize
for giving him such a hard time.

06:48.830 --> 06:51.960
Just another reason why
I've gotta destroy Yachiho!

06:52.750 --> 06:55.790
Golden Hour
can't be activated instantaneously.

06:55.790 --> 07:01.880
<b>NEAR</b>

06:56.170 --> 06:59.040
The trigger is that weird pose of hers,

06:59.040 --> 07:01.630
so depending on our position
when she starts to move,

07:01.630 --> 07:03.250
it's our cue to either attack or retreat.

07:01.880 --> 07:05.080
<b>FAR</b>

07:05.130 --> 07:06.250
What's more,

07:06.250 --> 07:10.750
we can tell whether or not she already
used her ability based on her behavior.

07:11.040 --> 07:14.330
If she's tired all of a sudden,
it's proof that she rewound time.

07:14.330 --> 07:17.040
Then we change things up
and hightail it out of there!

07:27.000 --> 07:28.250
It's a drain on her energy,

07:28.250 --> 07:30.920
so she can only use her ability
a few more times at best.

07:30.920 --> 07:33.710
If we can make her waste it,
we're guaranteed to win!

07:34.750 --> 07:37.750
...I bet that's exactly
what Himari's thinking right now!

07:37.750 --> 07:40.250
I've figured out her logic
and her strategy.

07:40.250 --> 07:44.080
I'll drag her back home
and make her life a living hell!

07:44.080 --> 07:46.750
Guess it's time... to play my trump card.

07:48.630 --> 07:50.250
Feel the power...

07:50.880 --> 07:52.500
of your big sister!

07:52.500 --> 07:54.960
She's going to freeze time!
We're safe at this-

07:57.790 --> 07:59.170
Prime Time!

07:59.170 --> 08:01.420
<b>AZUMA O'CLOCK: PRIME TIME</b>

08:02.250 --> 08:03.960
Freeze for 10 seconds!

08:15.710 --> 08:19.880
If it were only five seconds,
she'd be outside my attack range...

08:20.080 --> 08:22.460
But with a 10-second head start,
she can't escape!

08:36.380 --> 08:37.500
<b>7th Squadron</b>

08:40.880 --> 08:43.540
Wh-what just happened?!

08:44.130 --> 08:48.000
Himari turned up the heat,
but now she's down for the count!

08:53.080 --> 08:54.540
"Prime Time."

08:54.540 --> 08:58.710
By striking the ultimate pose,
I double the amount of time I can control.

09:00.000 --> 09:03.670
The downside was that it took
a few seconds longer

09:03.670 --> 09:05.250
than Golden Hour to activate.

09:05.880 --> 09:09.460
But at that distance,
I knew you'd dodge my attack

09:09.460 --> 09:12.580
if I made a show
of getting into my majestic pose!

09:15.670 --> 09:17.670
C-can you believe it?!

09:17.670 --> 09:19.330
Double the Golden Hour!

09:19.330 --> 09:23.170
That means Yachiho must've frozen time
for an entire 10 seconds!

09:24.170 --> 09:26.630
But how... did you...

09:28.040 --> 09:31.670
A genius such as I
only gets more brilliant over time!

09:31.670 --> 09:35.330
Not including that in your calculations
was your downfall!

09:50.380 --> 09:52.540
Himari threw a wrench
into her opponent's plans

09:52.540 --> 09:56.040
on account of her slave's
high-speed maneuverability!

09:56.290 --> 09:57.420
But then...

09:57.420 --> 09:58.960
Yachiho unleashed her trump card,

09:58.960 --> 10:02.960
an ability called "Prime Time,"
and totally turned the tables on her!

10:02.960 --> 10:04.250
Everything happened so fast,

10:04.250 --> 10:06.790
I could barely even tell
what the heck was going on!

10:07.250 --> 10:09.130
Can the 6th Squadron pull through

10:09.130 --> 10:12.750
and clinch victory in this battle
between seconds-in-command?!

10:13.080 --> 10:15.710
W-will she be all right?

10:17.170 --> 10:18.380
<b>HIMARI AZUMA</b>

10:18.380 --> 10:20.670
It ain't over yet! Stand up!

10:18.380 --> 10:23.670
<b>7th Squadron</b>

10:18.380 --> 10:23.670
<b>HIMARI AZUMA</b>

10:20.670 --> 10:23.710
Now's the time to show 'em
what the 7th Squadron's made of!

10:24.130 --> 10:26.000
Hang in there!
Hooray, hooray!<b></b>

10:26.000 --> 10:27.790
Go, Miss Himari! Go, Mr. Yuuki!
You got this! Blow her outta the water!<b></b>

10:27.790 --> 10:31.790
When Learning adapts an ability
that comes with a cost attached,

10:31.790 --> 10:35.580
she can't execute a skill switch
until the price is paid.

10:35.580 --> 10:39.630
That's why she can't just up
and change abilities mid-match.

10:39.960 --> 10:42.580
Think back to the past, Himari.

10:43.540 --> 10:47.130
You were never up to snuff
when it was something important.

10:47.130 --> 10:48.830
This time is no different.

10:49.290 --> 10:52.540
You don't have a way
to counter Prime Time, do you?

10:52.540 --> 10:54.790
Just give up, Himari.

10:58.670 --> 11:00.920
Is it happening again?

11:00.920 --> 11:02.920
Were all my efforts in vain?

11:03.710 --> 11:04.710
Hey...

11:05.500 --> 11:07.920
You know she's trying
to psych us out, right?

11:08.380 --> 11:09.460
Yuuki...

11:10.250 --> 11:12.250
Look at your sister's face.

11:12.580 --> 11:14.290
That ability took a toll on her...

11:14.290 --> 11:15.710
She's exhausted.

11:15.710 --> 11:17.750
In fact, she probably can't use it again!

11:21.500 --> 11:24.080
Quitting when we're this close to victory?

11:24.080 --> 11:27.130
I'd be ashamed if my master
did something that stupid!

11:28.040 --> 11:30.670
You're clearly
running out of steam, too...

11:30.670 --> 11:34.630
And you've got an awfully
smart mouth for a slave...

11:36.380 --> 11:38.210
I'll punish you when this is over!

11:40.540 --> 11:42.460
She's up!

11:42.460 --> 11:45.330
It looked like the
end of the line for Himari,

11:45.330 --> 11:47.540
but she's back on her feet once more!

11:47.540 --> 11:50.210
Could we be approaching
the grand finale at last?!

11:50.210 --> 11:51.880
<b>7th Squadron</b>

11:50.210 --> 11:51.880
<b>HIMARI AZUMA</b>

11:50.880 --> 11:51.920
Hell yeah!

11:54.000 --> 11:57.500
Aw, she managed to stand up...

11:59.830 --> 12:02.000
No more of this shameful behavior.

12:02.000 --> 12:03.960
You wouldn't want
to embarrass your commander.

12:03.960 --> 12:06.130
I could easily freeze time again and-

12:06.130 --> 12:08.290
Staying strong
and fighting to the finish...

12:10.630 --> 12:13.670
isn't considered shameful
in the 7th Squadron!

12:14.000 --> 12:16.040
I thought breaking her spirit now

12:16.040 --> 12:18.880
would make it easier
to train her later on, but...

12:18.880 --> 12:20.130
Do what we practiced!

12:20.130 --> 12:20.880
Got it!

12:21.540 --> 12:22.790
Golden Hour!

12:28.000 --> 12:29.380
I can't see!

12:29.380 --> 12:31.210
But I already struck a pose!

12:31.420 --> 12:32.630
Rewind five seconds!

12:33.790 --> 12:35.580
It's time to end this!

12:37.210 --> 12:38.080
Wha-?!

12:41.880 --> 12:44.380
I can't see Himari!

13:13.000 --> 13:15.670
Didn't think you were THAT desperate...

13:15.960 --> 13:17.710
Annoying little...

13:23.170 --> 13:24.380
Can it be...

13:38.210 --> 13:39.580
It's all over, folks!

13:40.080 --> 13:42.420
Himari Azuma is the winner!
Congratulations, Miss Himari!<b>
</b>We knew you could do it!<b></b>

13:42.420 --> 13:42.670
Yeah, that was awesome!
You looked so cool out there!

13:42.670 --> 13:45.500
That's one point for the 7th Squadron!
Yeah, that was awesome!<b>
</b>You looked so cool out there!<b></b>

13:46.130 --> 13:50.210
They used the flash and smoke from Yuuki's
reverse transformation to blind her...

13:50.210 --> 13:53.130
Not bad. You two really did your research.

13:53.960 --> 13:57.130
Oh no... Yacchi lost the match...

13:57.130 --> 14:00.420
Let's think of it as an opportunity
to learn from her mistakes.

14:06.210 --> 14:07.130
Mr. Yuuki!

14:07.130 --> 14:08.130
Yukki!

14:10.290 --> 14:12.170
There's no need to worry.

14:20.170 --> 14:22.540
Huh? I...

14:22.750 --> 14:25.290
You lost consciousness after getting shot.

14:27.830 --> 14:30.250
Ordinarily, injuries like these
would be life-threatening.

14:30.250 --> 14:33.790
But since you sustained them inside
my barrier, they'll heal up good as new.

14:37.380 --> 14:38.210
There.

14:38.210 --> 14:40.540
You're all clear to move around again.

14:42.750 --> 14:45.920
That's amazing... It's already gone.

14:48.000 --> 14:48.380
Get off!

14:48.380 --> 14:49.210
Ouch-!
Get off!<b></b>

14:49.210 --> 14:50.580
She said you're back to normal.

14:50.580 --> 14:52.420
You've got no excuse
to lean on me like that.

14:52.420 --> 14:54.330
Cut me some slack, wouldja?!

14:54.330 --> 14:57.380
I was literally unconscious
until thirty seconds ago!

15:01.630 --> 15:02.920
We actually did it.

15:07.920 --> 15:10.880
Now that I can relax, I'm really thirsty.

15:10.880 --> 15:12.830
Well, you did a lot of running.

15:23.250 --> 15:25.630
Our timing on that one was perfect!

15:25.960 --> 15:27.130
I know, right?

15:31.210 --> 15:34.170
I remember when you caught a nasty cold
right before entrance exams

15:34.170 --> 15:36.580
'cause you worked yourself to the bone.

15:37.460 --> 15:39.460
I saw an overachiever,

15:39.460 --> 15:42.210
and I thought you
were pretty naïve, but...

15:46.580 --> 15:48.380
Let's go get something to drink.

15:48.380 --> 15:50.040
I worked up a thirst, too.

15:50.040 --> 15:51.040
Hold it, Himari!

15:58.960 --> 16:00.210
Uh...

16:05.210 --> 16:08.750
You've gotten stronger,
I'll admit that much.

16:08.750 --> 16:10.880
I'll be sure to treat you better.

16:10.880 --> 16:14.130
So you're ready to join
the Azuma Family again, right?

16:16.920 --> 16:18.960
Come home, Himari.

16:20.880 --> 16:21.960
Yachiho...

16:23.330 --> 16:26.960
The 7th Squadron is where I belong now.

16:26.960 --> 16:28.080
Huh?

16:28.380 --> 16:31.790
There's nothing you can say
to convince me to go back.

16:34.420 --> 16:35.710
C'mon, let's go.

16:35.710 --> 16:36.540
'Kay.

16:37.380 --> 16:38.880
Oh goodness...

16:38.880 --> 16:40.330
Poor Yacchi...

16:40.330 --> 16:44.420
She's just got an unconventional way
of expressing her love!

16:44.960 --> 16:46.960
Come on, let's go get you changed.

16:46.960 --> 16:49.130
There, there... Don't cry!

17:00.290 --> 17:01.580
Don't mind if I-

17:21.040 --> 17:22.420
Is that...

17:23.210 --> 17:25.170
my reward this time?

17:26.920 --> 17:28.750
Guess it's starting...

17:32.000 --> 17:34.000
Let's go over the first match.

17:34.000 --> 17:35.710
Pay attention, Yachiho.

17:38.290 --> 17:42.420
I've been told this was the little slave's
first fight against a person.

17:42.420 --> 17:44.130
He knew your wounds would heal,

17:44.130 --> 17:47.920
but there's a chance he subconsciously
put the brakes on his attacks.

17:48.290 --> 17:50.460
If what you said was true,

17:50.460 --> 17:53.170
then that first direct hit would've killed
you instantly.

17:50.630 --> 17:51.580
<b>BRAND BREAK!</b>

17:53.170 --> 17:54.920
Something to consider, perhaps.

17:57.210 --> 17:58.830
That's not all, either.

17:58.830 --> 18:01.630
After activating Prime Time,
it was extremely foolish

18:01.630 --> 18:04.330
to allow your opponent a reprieve
instead of finishing her off immediately.

18:05.210 --> 18:07.460
Never underestimate the enemy.

18:08.460 --> 18:10.500
Okay, okay...

18:11.210 --> 18:12.710
Now, that boy...

18:12.960 --> 18:15.250
The way he kept pushing and pushing,

18:15.250 --> 18:17.420
using himself as a decoy
at the last second...

18:17.880 --> 18:21.130
That's a slave if ever there was one!

18:23.830 --> 18:26.250
Miss Himari sure is taking a long time...

18:26.250 --> 18:28.710
Should I go check on her and Mr. Yuuki?

18:28.710 --> 18:30.670
Oh, I'll just go get 'em myself!

18:30.670 --> 18:33.750
I worked up a thirst
after all that cheering we did.

18:34.670 --> 18:36.130
Your match starts soon.

18:36.130 --> 18:38.130
Be careful not to drink too much water.

18:38.130 --> 18:39.540
Roger, roger!

18:40.670 --> 18:42.420
Himarin pulled out all the stops.

18:42.420 --> 18:45.750
I wanna try and impress Yukki
with my skills, too!

18:49.040 --> 18:50.670
'Cause of you...

18:51.080 --> 18:54.460
You're the reason I beat my sister, Yuuki.

18:55.290 --> 18:57.210
Th-thank you.

18:58.330 --> 18:59.710
Himari...

19:01.920 --> 19:06.080
I want you to know I'm not just
saying that as part of your reward...

19:09.960 --> 19:11.750
I really mean it.

19:22.880 --> 19:24.460
Wait, was that...

19:24.460 --> 19:26.630
It wasn't my choice,
I was forced to do it!

19:26.630 --> 19:28.380
I thought that was obvious!

19:28.380 --> 19:32.250
I swear, this reward of yours
is so obscene...

19:40.750 --> 19:43.460
Himari's got a sharp tongue,
but her lips...

19:45.210 --> 19:47.880
Her lips are unbelievably soft!

19:48.170 --> 19:49.580
O-oh, um...

19:49.580 --> 19:52.080
A-are you sure about
not going back home?

19:52.420 --> 19:53.790
I'm sure.

19:54.130 --> 19:56.670
The commander helped me out
when things were tough.

19:56.670 --> 19:58.750
I'm sticking by her side.

20:05.330 --> 20:06.670
I, uh...

20:08.290 --> 20:11.500
I've been kind of cruel to you, and...

20:11.500 --> 20:12.880
I'm sorry.

20:14.540 --> 20:16.580
Boys are okay sometimes.

20:20.540 --> 20:23.710
Thanks, u-um... Miss Himari...

20:23.710 --> 20:25.040
You can drop the "Miss."

20:25.040 --> 20:27.250
Given the circumstances,
it feels weird to be formal.

20:27.250 --> 20:30.040
But kissing is the price of the ability,
nothing more!

20:30.040 --> 20:31.580
So don't get the wrong idea!

20:31.580 --> 20:33.250
I'm fully aware!

20:43.250 --> 20:46.670
THAT'S what she meant by
"physically demanding"?!

20:56.380 --> 20:59.920
Sorry, Sahara... for losing my match.

21:00.710 --> 21:02.670
It's up to you now...

21:04.290 --> 21:05.210
Sahara?

21:05.210 --> 21:06.080
Zzzzz...

21:06.080 --> 21:07.540
W-wake up!

21:07.540 --> 21:09.040
The next round is starting soon!

21:09.040 --> 21:10.250
Hello, Sahara?!

21:10.250 --> 21:11.460
Sahara!

21:12.540 --> 21:13.670
Sahara?

21:16.290 --> 21:17.540
How do you feel?

21:19.630 --> 21:22.790
I got this, just like I always do!

23:11.040 --> 23:13.630
<b>TEACH US! NEI-SENPAI!</b>

23:11.460 --> 23:12.540
"Teach Us! Nei-"

23:13.460 --> 23:14.500
Today I, the elegant Yachiho,

23:13.630 --> 23:17.420
<b>AZUMA TIME: GOLDEN HOUR</b>

23:14.500 --> 23:17.040
will be imparting my knowledge upon you
in a clear and concise manner.

23:17.040 --> 23:19.710
So keep a close eye
on my sublime visage, Himari!

23:19.710 --> 23:22.380
My "Golden Hour" is an
extraordinarily rare and elegant ability

23:22.380 --> 23:23.880
activated by striking a majestic pose

23:23.880 --> 23:26.130
that allows me to pause
or rewind time for five seconds!

23:26.130 --> 23:27.920
I freeze the Shuuki in place,
then I use bullets

23:27.920 --> 23:30.540
attuned to Mato's unique mystical
properties to shoot 'em down!

23:30.710 --> 23:31.790
What do you think, Himari?!

23:31.790 --> 23:34.130
If that intimidates you, then return to
the Azuma household immediately!

23:34.130 --> 23:35.000
You'll be my-

23:35.420 --> 23:37.130
Ahem! Please excuse her.

23:37.130 --> 23:39.210
Next time: "Blitz, Sahara, Twinkle"

23:37.540 --> 23:41.000
<b>BLITZ,</b>

23:37.540 --> 23:41.000
<b>SAHARA,</b>

23:37.540 --> 23:41.000
<b>TWINKLE</b>

23:39.210 --> 23:40.630
Thanks for watching!
